#* {{quote-book|year=2005|author=Nedra M. Shivers|title=Redeeming Daddy|page=1|passage=I don't give a damn where yo' '''Lucky Charms'''-eating ass came from; just get yo' leprechaun ass up front to the visiting room now!}}
